    <div class="flow">
        <section class="now-reading">
            <h2>Reading</h2>
            <p>Mostly reading fantasy these days, but I'm trying to pass the festering bolus of <em>Gone with the Wind</em>. I truly hate that book, but one of my life goals is to read all the Pulitzer Prize fiction winners, of which it is one. It is a book I believe should not exist, but I'll write more about it when I'm done and post a review.</p>
            <ul class="now-reading-list">
                {%- for book in nowReading -%}
