            <p><a href="https://bookriot.com/listen/shows/thepodcast/">Book Riot - The Podcast</a> - Best book podcast I've tried. Jeff and Rebecca's rapport is brilliant, and they talk about the kinds of books I'm interested in.</p>
            <p><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-ezra-klein-show/id1548604447">The Ezra Klein Show</a> - I know he's demonized by parts of the progressive left, which is where my beliefs tend to align. But the way he tries to understand and think through even the wildest MAGA bullshit has some value for me. YMMV</p>
